{
  "schema_version": "report-evidence/1",
  "source_sha256": "c3f3baeb4685ba88fcf2065dcb1e94eff66066084d119f52714b40400ba8ff2a",
  "fragments": [
    {
      "id": "e_c3f3baeb4685_0001",
      "text": "Reentrancy in `withdraw` allows erasing debt via `updateDebt` inside the same lock, enabling free token withdrawal",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 114,
      "line": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "e_c3f3baeb4685_0002",
      "text": "##  **Summary**",
      "start": 116,
      "end": 131,
      "line": 3
    },
    {
      "id": "e_c3f3baeb4685_0003",
      "text": "`FlashAccountant` relies on lock‑scoped debt accounting and expects that any debt added inside a lock must be fully settled before the lock closes.",
      "start": 133,
      "end": 280,
      "line": 5
    },
    {
      "id": "e_c3f3baeb4685_0004",
      "text": "However, a malicious ERC20 token can **re-enter during `withdraw()`** and call:",
      "start": 283,
      "end": 362,
      "line": 6
    },
    {
      "id": "e_c3f3baeb4685_0005",
      "text": "inside **the same lock ID**, effectively erasing the debt added by `withdraw`.",
      "start": 365,
      "end": 443,
      "line": 9
    },
    {
      "id": "e_c3f3baeb4685_0006",
      "text": "The lock finishes successfully (no `DebtsNotZeroed` revert) while the accountant **has already transferred tokens to the attacker**.",
      "start": 445,
      "end": 577,
      "line": 11
    },
    {
      "id": "e_c3f3baeb4685_0007",
      "text": "This results in **free withdrawal of funds**.",
      "start": 579,
      "end": 624,
      "line": 13
    },
    {
      "id": "e_c3f3baeb4685_0008",
      "text": "---",
      "start": 626,
      "end": 629,
      "line": 15
    },
    {
      "id": "e_c3f3baeb4685_0009",
      "text": "##  **Root Cause**",
      "start": 631,
      "end": 649,
      "line": 17
    },
    {
      "id": "e_c3f3baeb4685_0010",
      "text": "1. `withdraw()` adds debt:",
      "start": 651,
      "end": 677,
      "line": 19
    },
    {
      "id": "e_c3f3baeb4685_0011",
      "text": "2. Then attempts:",
      "start": 678,
      "end": 695,
      "line": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "e_c3f3baeb4685_0012",
      "text": "3. A malicious token can re-enter in `transfer()` and execute:",
      "start": 696,
      "end": 758,
      "line": 21
    },
    {
      "id": "e_c3f3baeb4685_0013",
      "text": "4. `updateDebt`:",
      "start": 759,
      "end": 775,
      "line": 22
    },
    {
      "id": "e_c3f3baeb4685_0014",
      "text": "- lacks caller authorization",
      "start": 779,
      "end": 807,
      "line": 23
    },
    {
      "id": "e_c3f3baeb4685_0015",
      "text": "- applies deltas to **the current lock**",
      "start": 813,
      "end": 853,
      "line": 24
    },
    {
      "id": "e_c3f3baeb4685_0016",
      "text": "- allows **negative deltas**",
      "start": 859,
      "end": 887,
      "line": 25
    },
    {
      "id": "e_c3f3baeb4685_0017",
      "text": "5. Debt becomes zero.",
      "start": 889,
      "end": 910,
      "line": 27
    },
    {
      "id": "e_c3f3baeb4685_0018",
      "text": "6. Lock closes with no detection.",
      "start": 913,
      "end": 946,
      "line": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "e_c3f3baeb4685_0019",
      "text": "7. Attacker keeps the tokens.",
      "start": 949,
      "end": 978,
      "line": 29
    },
    {
      "id": "e_c3f3baeb4685_0020",
      "text": "**Scope Consideration (IMPORTANT)**",
      "start": 980,
      "end": 1015,
      "line": 31
    },
    {
      "id": "e_c3f3baeb4685_0021",
      "text": "Ekubo is a **permissionless AMM**:",
      "start": 1017,
      "end": 1051,
      "line": 33
    },
    {
      "id": "e_c3f3baeb4685_0022",
      "text": "- Any ERC20 token can be listed.",
      "start": 1053,
      "end": 1085,
      "line": 35
    },
    {
      "id": "e_c3f3baeb4685_0023",
      "text": "- The contracts **do not whitelist tokens**.",
      "start": 1086,
      "end": 1130,
      "line": 36
    },
    {
      "id": "e_c3f3baeb4685_0024",
      "text": "- Arbitrary token behavior is allowed unless explicitly excluded in `scope.txt`.",
      "start": 1131,
      "end": 1211,
      "line": 37
    }
  ]
}
